# Example API requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client format).
@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = change-me

### Health (no auth)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Connected repositories
GET {{base}}/api/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Connect a GitHub repository (needs FORGEFLOW_GITHUB_TOKEN)
POST {{base}}/api/repositories/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"provider": "github", "full_name": "owner/repository"}

### Submit a feature request
POST {{base}}/api/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"repository_id": "<repo id>", "workflow": "feature",
 "request": "Add JWT authentication to this FastAPI application"}

### Investigate a bug
POST {{base}}/api/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"repository_id": "<repo id>", "workflow": "bug_investigation",
 "request": "PATCH /tasks/{id} with completed=false does not reopen a completed task"}

### Review a GitHub pull request
POST {{base}}/api/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"repository_id": "<repo id>", "workflow": "code_review", "request": "Review PR 17", "params": {"pr_number": 17}}

### Live events (Server-Sent Events; resume with Last-Event-ID)
GET {{base}}/api/executions/<execution id>/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Agent runs, tool calls, tokens and cost
GET {{base}}/api/executions/<execution id>/trace
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pending approvals
GET {{base}}/api/approvals?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve (resumes the workflow and opens the pull request)
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/<approval id>/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "Reviewed the diff and test results."}
